{"version":1,"timestamp":"2026-10-18T11:55:53.653Z","runId":"run_mvdrrfw2_61dcoz1","type":"observation","payload":{"snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","documentId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains","title":"www.iana.org","visibleText":"Domains\nProtocols\nNumbers\nAbout\nInstructions and Guides\nExample Domains\nA number of domains such as\nexample.com\nand\nexample.org\nare maintained\nfor documentation purposes. These domains may be used as illustrative\nexamples in documents without prior coordination with us. They are not\navailable for registration or transfer.\nWe provide a web service on the example domain hosts to provide basic\ninformation on the purpose of the domain. These web services are\nprovided as best effort, but are not designed to support production\napplications. We strongly recommend you do not design applications that\nrequire the example domains to have operating HTTP service.\nFurther Reading\nIANA-managed Reserved Domains\nSpecial-Use Domain Names\n(RFC 6761)\nReserved Top Level DNS Names\n(RFC 2606)\nLast revised\n2026-09-27\n.\nDomain Names\nRoot Zone Registry\n.INT Registry\n.ARPA Registry\nIDN Repository\nNumber Resources\nNumber Registries\nRIR Allocation Data\nAbuse Information\nProtocols\nProtocol Registries\nTime Zone Database\nAbout Us\nNews\nPerformance\nThe Organization\nArchive\nContact Us\nThe IANA functions coordinate the Internet’s globally unique identifiers, and\n                are provided by\nPublic Technical Identifiers\n, an affiliate of\nICANN\n.\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Service","passages":[{"text":"Domains","kind":"document","id":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb:p1","snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains"},{"text":"Protocols","kind":"document","id":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb:p2","snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains"},{"text":"Numbers","kind":"document","id":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb:p3","snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains"},{"text":"About","kind":"document","id":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb:p4","snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains"},{"text":"Instructions and Guides","kind":"document","id":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb:p5","snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains"},{"text":"Example Domains","kind":"document","id":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb:p6","snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains"},{"text":"A number of domains such as","kind":"document","id":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb:p7","snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains"},{"text":"example.com","kind":"document","id":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb:p8","snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains"},{"text":"and","kind":"document","id":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb:p9","snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains"},{"text":"example.org","kind":"document","id":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb:p10","snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains"},{"text":"are maintained\nfor documentation purposes. These domains may be used as illustrative\nexamples in documents without prior coordination with us. They are not\navailable for registration or transfer.","kind":"document","id":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb:p11","snapshotId":"08ec2250-c089-461d-9e06-9808145063cb","url":"https://www.iana.org/help/example-domains"},{"text":"We provide a web service on the example domain hosts to provide bas